      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property are delighted to bring to the market No. 25 Clos Emer, an exceptional A-Rated three-bedroom duplex home, ideally located within the new development of Clos Emer, Saltown, Dundalk.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to first-time buyers, this home offers an excellent opportunity to step onto the property ladder and provides a smart alternative to renting.\r\n\r\nNo. 25 Clos Emer will be presented completely turnkey and ready for immediate occupation, with painting, tiling and new floor coverings all included. Combining modern design with energy efficiency, this impressive A-rated home is economical to run and offers the potential for ongoing savings on energy bills.\r\n\r\nThe development is conveniently located on a bus route, providing easy access to Dundalk town centre and a wide range of local services and amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property may also qualify for the Help to Buy Scheme, providing assistance of up to 10% of the purchase price, subject to Revenue terms and conditions.\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €305,000\r\n\r\nFor all further inquiries, Contact Blue Sky Property 042-9329333 or log on to www.closemer.com.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
